      "q": "23.\nThe rate constant for the decomposition of hydrocarbons is ${\\text{2}}{{.418\u00a0 \\times\u00a0 1}}{{\\text{0}}^{{\\text{ - 5}}}}{{\\text{s}}^{{\\text{ - 1}}}}$ at 546 k. If the energy\u00a0 of activation is 179.9 kJ /mol, what will be the value of pre-exponential factor.",
