      "q": "12. Which compound in each of the following pairs will react faster in ${{\\text{S}}_{\\text{N}}}\\text{2}$\u00a0 reaction with $\\text{O}{{\\text{H}}^{\\text{-}}}$?\n(i) $\\text{C}{{\\text{H}}_{\\text{3}}}\\text{Br}$ or $\\text{C}{{\\text{H}}_{\\text{3}}}\\text{I}$",
